% Generate `web/src/components/icons.jsx`: a set of inline, dependency-free stroke icons —
% aesthetic, `currentColor`, 16px by default. Used across the dashboard (BYOK) and the studio
% toolbar (undo/redo). RULES.md forbids emoji, so these are the aesthetic replacements. Match
% Lucide's 24×24 stroke language; no external icon library. Icon path data is exact — the SVG
% children shown below must be reproduced verbatim.

Export a `Svg` wrapper: props `{ size = 16, style, ...p }`. Renders an `<svg>` with
`viewBox="0 0 24 24"`, `width={size}` `height={size}`, `fill="none"`, `stroke="currentColor"`,
`strokeWidth="1.8"`, round `strokeLinecap`/`strokeLinejoin`, `aria-hidden="true"`,
`style={{ verticalAlign: '-0.125em', ...style }}`, and `{...p}` spread last (so children pass
through).

Export each icon as `export const IconName = (p) => <Svg {...p}>…</Svg>` with these exact
children (stroke paths unless a per-element `fill`/`stroke` override is shown):

- IconKey: `<circle cx="7.5" cy="15.5" r="4.5" /><path d="M11 12 20 3" /><path d="m16 7 3 3" /><path d="m13.5 9.5 2.5 2.5" />`
- IconEye: `<path d="M2 12s3.5-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.5 7-10 7-10-7-10-7Z" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" />`
- IconEyeOff: `<path d="M9.9 4.24A9.1 9.1 0 0 1 12 4c6.5 0 10 8 10 8a18 18 0 0 1-2.16 3.19" /><path d="M6.6 6.6A18 18 0 0 0 2 12s3.5 8 10 8a9.3 9.3 0 0 0 5.4-1.6" /><path d="M9.88 9.88a3 3 0 1 0 4.24 4.24" /><path d="M2 2l20 20" />`
- IconCheck: `<path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />`
- IconX: `<path d="M18 6 6 18" /><path d="m6 6 12 12" />`
- IconUndo: `<path d="M9 14 4 9l5-5" /><path d="M4 9h10.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 5.5 5.5 5.5 5.5 0 0 1-5.5 5.5H11" />`
- IconRedo: `<path d="m15 14 5-5-5-5" /><path d="M20 9H9.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 4 14.5 5.5 5.5 0 0 0 9.5 20H11" />`
- IconPlay: `<path d="M6 4v16l13-8z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />`
- IconMusic: `<path d="M9 18V5l11-2v13" /><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3" /><circle cx="17" cy="16" r="3" />`
- IconRefresh: `<path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-2.64-6.36" /><path d="M21 3v5h-5" />`
- IconAlert: `<path d="M12 9v4" /><path d="M12 17h.01" /><path d="M10.3 3.9 2.4 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h15.8a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0Z" />`
- IconMessage: `<path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-8.5 8.5 9 9 0 0 1-4-.9L3 20l1.9-5.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-4A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 12.5 3 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 21 11.5Z" />`
- IconMovie: `<rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2" /><path d="M8 4v16M16 4v16M4 8h4M4 16h4M16 8h4M16 16h4M4 12h16" />`
- IconMic: `<rect x="9" y="2" width="6" height="11" rx="3" /><path d="M5 10a7 7 0 0 0 14 0" /><path d="M12 17v4" /><path d="M8 21h8" />`
- IconStar: `<path d="M12 3l2.7 5.5 6.1.9-4.4 4.3 1 6.1-5.4-2.9-5.4 2.9 1-6.1-4.4-4.3 6.1-.9z" />`
- IconBrain: `<path d="M12 5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0-4.9-.6A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 6.8a2.5 2.5 0 0 0-1 4.4 2.6 2.6 0 0 0 1 4.5 2.5 2.5 0 0 0 3.2 2.7A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 12 19z" /><path d="M12 5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4.9-.6A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 20 6.8a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 1 4.4 2.6 2.6 0 0 1-1 4.5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-3.2 2.7A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 12 19z" /><path d="M12 5v14" />`
- IconTool: `<path d="M15.5 4.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-4.7 4.6l-6 6a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 2.4 2.4l6-6a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 4.6-4.7l-2.3 2.3-2-.5-.5-2z" />`
