- IconWorld: `<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" /><path d="M3.6 9h16.8M3.6 15h16.8" /><path d="M12 3a15 15 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a15 15 0 0 0 0 18" />`
- IconListCheck: `<path d="m3.5 6 1.5 1.5L8 4.5" /><path d="m3.5 13 1.5 1.5L8 11.5" /><path d="M12 6h9M12 13h9M12 20h9" />`
- IconListDetails: `<rect x="3" y="4" width="6" height="6" rx="1" /><rect x="3" y="14" width="6" height="6" rx="1" /><path d="M13 5h8M13 9h5M13 15h8M13 19h5" />`

Export `ClaudeLogo` — the Claude sunburst mark, 8 filled rays radiating from center in Claude's
terracotta. Props `{ size = 18, color = 'currentColor', ...p }`. Build a `rays` array by looping
`i` 0→7, pushing `<line key={i} x1="12" y1="12" x2="12" y2="3.2" transform={`rotate(${i * 45} 12 12)`} />`.
Render a bare `<svg>` (NOT the `Svg` wrapper): `width={size}` `height={size}`,
`viewBox="0 0 24 24"`, `fill="none"`, `stroke={color}`, `strokeWidth="2.4"`,
`strokeLinecap="round"`, `aria-hidden="true"`, `{...p}`, children = `{rays}`.
